This package adds a sharp normalized scalar-range proof and checker for the fixed role-1256 graph. Clear1nsight supplied that graph in PR #7704; SYLforge supplied its nine-swap source word in PR #7700. Preserve CREDITS.md, LICENSE and the original notices in credits/ when redistributing the graph. The retained sources credit DreamingOfClouds, Ali Romman, Rohan Arun, Jerry Chen (CubeJerry), Douglas Colkitt and the earlier community lineage. No complete multiplication theorem or selected-frontier change is claimed.
